trong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the story is <strong>revealed further and further</strong>, with environments providing some clues. The game uses text conversations and documents to tell its story, focusing only on the essentials to prioritise quality over quantity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The central point of your adventure is the origin of the <strong>strange Signal</strong> that drew you here. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
